{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2022-12", "window": 4, "start_date": 1671840000, "end_date": 1672531199, "month_true_total": 212, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 18:02:40 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "129808987", "author": {"steamid": "76561198799632276", "personaname": "Nutorious B.I.G.", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198799632276/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 1378, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1036, "last_played": 1690511485, "avatar": "4f7bcfd19d6cfaec1b48a8d5b6512100e46b3059"}, "language": "english", "review": "purging heretics is pretty fun", "timestamp_created": 1672524647, "timestamp_updated": 1672524647, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "129797584", "author": {"steamid": "76561198018450069", "personaname": "Night Geisha", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/NightGeisha/", "num_games_owned": 900, "num_reviews": 690, "playtime_forever": 908, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 908, "last_played": 1672511471, "avatar": "2bc6cadd6cb5c82671622235aada75b2bd12631d"}, "language": "english", "review": "It is always amazing to see a good old linear game providing long hours of fun and a lot of gunfight action. On the end of 2022 I get into a new Warhammer 40K vibe, thanks to Darktide. But taking into account that a new Space Marine will be launched next year I dig this pearl from my collection and played it for the first time. \n\nI never thought that I could have so much fun playing a game with more than 10 years. Visual is not great, specially since you cannot even get to high resolutions on it. But with a great story and a intense non-stop action gameplay this was without a doubt one of the best non-RTS games I have played under the Warhammer 40K franchise. \n\nYes it is old but is really really fun, and if that was not enough it is amazing to see a 10 year old game like this still with a comunity to play with. I was able to find people to play with in seconds so kudos to that as well. \nFully recommend this! Now is just wait for Space Marine 2!", "timestamp_created": 1672512403, "timestamp_updated": 1672512403, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "129789887", "author": {"steamid": "76561197980019822", "personaname": "Caffynated", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197980019822/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 863, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 863, "last_played": 1672416714, "avatar": "31466bfbfe84f6de72acab3334863ac0cceceef4"}, "language": "english", "review": "Honey, I Shrunk the Gundam. \n\nStep into the shoes of a miniaturized mech as it genocides an entire race of innocent, fun loving, green men.", "timestamp_created": 1672505205, "timestamp_updated": 1672505205, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "129784436", "author": {"steamid": "76561198332191083", "personaname": "jepetto85", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/jepetto85/"